.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-target-prune 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-target\-prune \- Reclaim superseded build artifacts, and refuse below the measured disk floor for the build the next lap will run
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten target prune\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reclaim superseded build artifacts, and refuse below the measured disk floor for the build the next lap will run
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview what would be applied, writing nothing
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR
The build directory to prune, instead of the configured one
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
